## Stack (baseline — full Pulse stack)

- **Next.js** **16.2.6** (pinned) App Router, **TypeScript** — [ADR-002](docs/prds/07_governance/adr_002_next162_vercel_runtime_policy.md)
- **Request interception:** **`proxy.ts`** (Next.js 16); `middleware.ts` — только временная миграция
- **Hosting:** Vercel · **UI:** shadcn/ui + Tailwind CSS v4 ({{DESIGN_SYSTEM_NAME}} tokens)
- **Database:** Neon **PostgreSQL 17** + **Prisma v7** (pooled `DATABASE_URL`, `DIRECT_URL` for migrations)
- **Auth:** Auth.js v5, **Credentials** (email + password), JWT sessions, role in token
- **Email:** Resend — **post-MVP** (MVP: schema `job_execution`/`delivery_log` only)
- **Storage:** **AWS S3** — presigned PUT/GET — [ADR-007](docs/prds/07_governance/adr_007_file_asset_blob_lifecycle.md)
- **Observability:** Sentry (`@sentry/nextjs`)
- **Monorepo:** `apps/web`, `apps/workers` (planned), `packages/{domain,policy,db}`

Runtime policy: [ADR-001](docs/prds/07_governance/adr_001_stack_and_runtime.md), [ADR-002](docs/prds/07_governance/adr_002_next162_vercel_runtime_policy.md).

